/kJnrKIt\nhttps://imgur.com/kI0S8Yq\n\nできれば絵の視点は3人を正面から眺めている視点でお願いします。\nhttps://imgur.com/lJfMyjD\nhttps://imgur.com/thlvvmN\n\n3人の体型は可能であればむちむち体型にしてください。\nhttps://imgur.com/3LJbYDM\nhttps://imgur.com/xFXcwrG\n\n背景はなくてもいいです。\n先生の絵が素敵で膝の上とかお尻までは見たいです!", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@booon315t/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3189539, "client_id": 1183097, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/602edf6f/uploads/origins/3f62d47e-0800-444f-bda3-23cc9de9a952?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c42e55e2076cebc01b63b040039a9c8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/602edf6f/uploads/origins/3f62d47e-0800-444f-bda3-23cc9de9a952?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c42e55e2076cebc01b63b040039a9c8, https://si.imgix.net/602edf6f/uploads/origins/3f62d47e-0800-444f-bda3-23cc9de9a952?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=af252881d59017ae50aec4d88f3ba9ff 2x, https://si.imgix.net/602edf6f/uploads/origins/3f62d47e-0800-444f-bda3-23cc9de9a952?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=619221d7344c62a47c158c640c7dff0d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/602edf6f/uploads/origins/3f62d47e-0800-444f-bda3-23cc9de9a952?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=485faf32a5a36b51db18f15740b15de3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/602edf6f/uploads/origins/3f62d47e-0800-444f-bda3-23cc9de9a952?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=485faf32a5a36b51db18f15740b15de3, https://si.imgix.net/602edf6f/uploads/origins/3f62d47e-0800-444f-bda3-23cc9de9a952?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=to